Place Hailo firmware blobs for Raspberry Pi 5 here.

Expected Hailo-8 filenames from the imported kernel driver:
- hailo8_fw.bin
- hailo8_board_cfg.bin
- hailo8_fw_cfg.bin

Target location inside Android:
- /vendor/firmware/hailo/hailo8_fw.bin
- /vendor/firmware/hailo/hailo8_board_cfg.bin
- /vendor/firmware/hailo/hailo8_fw_cfg.bin

The kernel driver requests these files via the firmware loader using the
relative paths under `hailo/`.
